-- NOT CALCULABLE - flagged, not fabricated (same gap as the SQL KPIs)
-- =============================================================
-- Product Return Rate : no returns field anywhere in the source data
-- Cost of Goods Sold   : no unit cost field anywhere in the source data
-- Promotions           : no promotions field anywhere in the source data
